!Name: p90backrake-2
!C A period 90 c/3 backwards rake.  This uses two period 45 c/3 puffers
!C whose exhaust has been perturbed by some c/3 edge spark spaceships.
!C A liberated glider from one puffer is bounced off of another puffer so
!C as to clean up both of the puffer's exhaust and also produce the backwards
!C glider.  This was the original rake found for c/3 puffers.
!C David I. Bell, May 1996
!Source: jslife-moving
!
